WEBVTT

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:00.620
CB to Focus One and Three,
final briefing is as follows.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.790
Delta One and Two will turn
left thirty degrees

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.660
after passing over a point 200 meters
southwest of the target from 3 o'clock.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.530
Enter the drop point four
seconds after that.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:13.400
The drop zone will be seven meters to
the rear and northwest of the target.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:17.440
The enemy is believed to possess a
bomb laced with industrial waste.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.310
This waste is potent enough to cause
lung cancer with the least exposure.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:26.680
The fuse's time delay can be preset
at two, three, or eight minutes.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:30.480
We must prevent activation of
this explosive at all costs.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:34.090
Focus One, acknowledged.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.520
Thirty seconds to drop.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.350
All units, prepare for impact.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:42.660
10...

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:43.560
9...

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.630
8...

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.630
7...

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.630
6...

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:47.630
5...

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.730
4...

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:49.700
3...

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:50.640
2...

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.540
1...

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.330
Zero!

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:02.680
All units dropped successfully, within
point five meters of targeted area.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.220
Focus One and Two, no
damage reported.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:08.590
Focus Three and Four, no damage
reported as well.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:11.720
Stresses resulting from the drop were
less than three point zero.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.690
Focus One, stresses less
than three point zero.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.900
Focus Two, no abnormalities other
than blood pressure rising 3.5.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.230
This will not impact operations.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:55.170
Irregular situation!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.530
Two wheeled armored combat vehicles

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:59.370
have entered the zone of engagement
for the primary staging area.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.210
Focus One, deploy to the rear right.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:04.580
Enemy combat vehicles will traverse
the wall to your forward right,

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.910
and enter your line of
direct engagement.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.460
Object Two has positioned itself five
meters behind Object One.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.960
Focus Four, cover Focus Three.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:28.900
Focus Two, pin down Object Two.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.730
Up.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:03.130
Some of the electrical circuits are still
at 40% below planned capacity,

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.470
but all else is proceeding as planned.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.670
Targeting enemy with
indirect guidance.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.360
Give me backup with the Big Eye.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.910
Signs of an ability phase
shift taking place.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.010
Captain Gowa?

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.920
Response rate has
increased dramatically.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:54.540
It's already reached a point where
the TA's Al cannot keep up.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.920
Heart rate 190.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.730
Blood pressure 178.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.960
Both continue to rise.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.450
Our MPU cannot keep up with the
response speed of Unit One.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.740
The movement of Unit One

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:15.330
continuously correlates with its
movement five seconds later.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:22.040
You mean the A2 system is functioning
as if it's predicting our orders?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.080
Heart rate has gone beyond 250.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.680
Increase is not slowing.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.650
Dopamine receptors are
increasingly active.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.860
Any problems?

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:35.460
So far nothing significant has come up.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:38.230
Have you checked Yushiro's data?

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:43.170
The data on his physical condition sent
by the SSDF covers all of the last year.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.170
Overall, I have to say
it's pretty amazing.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.940
He's had five mental bursts
during this time.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.740
An ability phase shift?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.640
He can't quite control it yet.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.620
Feedback to other units?

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.120
Focus Two, Three and
Four are reporting

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:07.820
40%, 45%, and 38% TA coefficient
response increases respectively.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:13.000
Focus Two cannot keep up with
the increased response rate.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.830
Receptor reaction is decreasing.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.470
Entering a slightly panicked state.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:20.940
With each successive generation
of Yushiro's mental bursts,

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.960
a phase shift occurs in the TA's.

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:27.250
I can't say why for sure.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:32.380
But a kai might be a unique
form of medium.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.790
Like a Shinto priestess
in a trance state?

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:39.420
As with a Noh dancer. I see.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.570
Physical condition now Level E.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.840
Increase the injection of
Compound C by 15%.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:51.970
Response rate still increasing.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.840
The trace level has risen to 98%.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:58.980
The question is,

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:02.140
will Yushiro be able to withstand the
stress of being the test subject?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.280
We'll cross that bridge
when we come to it.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:08.480
If push comes to shove, prioritize the
collection of data above all else.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.390
It's just like it was back then.

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:28.340
I can't believe it.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.940
Focus One has exceeded the limits of
the autonomous control system.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:35.110
It's operating strictly by virtue of its
independent motor reflex abilities.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.580
Heart rate: 300, and still rising!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.850
His physical condition has
gone beyond Level E.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.110
Impact.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.040
Physical condition has
reached Level S.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.370
This is getting out of hand.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.640
Colonel!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.270
Shut down all systems.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:34.240
Force discontinuation of simulation.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.710
Immediate shut down of
TA operations!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:51.750
So this completes all the
phase one test criteria.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.860
He'll finally be able to go home,

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.490
and return to his normal life.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.940
At the very least,

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:14.380
I'm certain we'll be able to exceed
the level attained eight years ago.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.660
Big brother?

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
There's something odd about
you, big brother.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.730
Big brother?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:46.580
You must not speak to the performer
in the dressing room.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.410
But I...

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.540
We'll move the sub monitor camera
forty centimeters closer to the stage.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.410
Check Monitor 3's operation.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.510
Hurry up with the simulation of the
motion tracking feedback circuitry.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:21.310
Graviton wave interference detector's
laser gyro, stabilized.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:23.370
Finished positioning all
deceleration agents.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.560
Eight years...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.330
Sorachi Kengyou,

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:41.420
will Yushiro be able to accurately
perform the ancient dance?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:46.200
There is no need for concern.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.670
I should hope not.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.850
The Dance of the Gasara grants
the kai his identity as a kai.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.480
You are well aware of this.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.610
That's right. That's how it needs to be.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:09.890
Understood.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.700
Just remember this.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.800
If this dance fails,

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:22.640
then one of the puppeteers you call
the kugutsu will be forever lost.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.570
Yushiro...

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.990
20...

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.230
19...

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.460
18...

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:44.730
17...

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:45.960
16...

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.130
15...

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.160
All personnel, retreat to Area B.
15...

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.170
All personnel, retreat to Area B.
14...

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:48.370
14...

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.600
13...

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.870
12...

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.240
11...

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.500
10...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.810
9...

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.070
8...

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.440
7...

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.780
6...

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.110
5...

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.080
4...

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.820
All personnel in their designated
positions.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.180
Begin the process.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:33.840
His heart rate is increasing at
an abnormally fast rate.

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:35.470
It's starting.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:39.480
Increase the sensitivity of the
physical data sensors.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.070
I don't want anything getting past us.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:52.820
Are you telling me someone else is
trying to invade the cross section?

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:54.760
That's the only logical explanation.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:56.730
Find the source of the energy.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.830
We can't let them make
contact before we do.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.630
Hurry up with the experiment.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.470
Increase the injection of
Compound D by 14%.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.340
Observation crew, begin
monitoring all activities.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.900
Distortion of the gravity field in
the space directly ahead.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.050
Will it come?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.330
Heart rate about to go above 300.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.160
Subject has erected a psychological
barrier on her own initiative.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.220
She's slipping away from our control.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.000
What's causing it?

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.100
Unknown.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.970
We are being blocked
from reaching inside

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:18.280
by her self-instigated
psychological barrier.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:23.010
She could be attempting a fusion
with another entity.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.750
Another entity?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.750
Miharu is an invitator.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.690
It's not outside the realm
of possibility.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:33.260
I'm willing to overlook some
physiological damage.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.530
Regain control over the
test subject's psyche.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.520
Yes, Sir.

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:05.750
What's happening, Yushiro?

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.760
The psyche of the test subject
has reinforced her barrier.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.730
All access has been blocked.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.360
Brainwaves are showing signs
of a conscious entity.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.370
The test subject appears
to have made contact.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.390
Increase injection of Compound D.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.580
Just a little longer.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.880
The entity has reinvigorated itself!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:31.610
Compound D buildup is reaching
dangerous levels.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.670
Distortion of the gravity field
has exceeded plus ten.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.300
Reading an energy reaction originating
from the center of the bell curve.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.610
It's just like the data from
eight years ago,

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:59.780
but the spatial distortion curve is
increasing even more than before.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.210
The rate of increase in the physical
condition is slowing!

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.650
Why? Why so strong?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:13.690
What's reinforcing the test subject
that it can go on like this?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.960
Interrupt the flow of oxygen.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.160
But the body...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:22.970
The body of the test subject will likely
suffer from oxygen deprivation.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.740
Sacrifices must be made.

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:29.200
It's imperative to protect the conscious
entity of the mother.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.540
Stop!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.140
Don't bring back

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.490
the terror!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.330
We've regained control
over the test subject.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.670
All right, check all vital signs.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:01.970
We will carry out the plan
once they've stabilized.

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.730
Rate of increase has returned
to its previous rate.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.320
Singularity readings are emanating
from the gravity field!

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:37.370
Heart rate has exceeded 500!

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.500
Keep going.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:42.650
Singularity enlarging!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:44.200
Energy readings emanating
from its center!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.260
Don't bring back the terror?

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.040
This will work! Finally!

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:22.480
The terror?

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:47.750
What is it? Why is he stopping?

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:51.080
The heart rate of the subject
is slowing rapidly.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.240
Has something happened to Yushiro?

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.290
He stopped dancing on his own?

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.560
That cannot be.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.860
Once a performer enters
into a trance state,

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:08.870
he can no longer stop dancing
of his own will.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.330
What about the energy
from the singularity?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.570
It is fluctuating slightly, but no major
change since it peaked.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:17.740
We must stabilize the
spatial distortion.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.800
Yushiro, dance. I said dance!

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:28.470
Go back.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.860
Energy readings are
converging rapidly.

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.030
Singularity has vanished.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:38.300
Spatial distortion is quickly
returning to normal.

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.930
We failed again.

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:41.730
Why did Yushiro stop?

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.060
I'm not sure.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:50.570
But at least we were able to obtain
a large amount of data.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.750
And now in market news...

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.450
We failed to make contact
at the last stage?

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:02.790
Unbelievable...

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:05.720
Yushiro stopped the experiment
of his own will?

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:08.210
I thought the psychological
manipulation was total.

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:13.960
Understood.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:22.510
The explosion observed in Belgistan
by a US military spy satellite

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:26.480
was determined by the United States
to be a weapon of mass destruction.

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:28.340
Their response...

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:33.420
Hark

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:39.870
It's time I journey

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:50.540
Break apart my heart

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:57.070
For crimson sadness

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:04.580
Pours out from it

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:08.500
I can only, oh

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.690
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:17.300
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:36.400
I can only, oh

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.550
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:44.750
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:52.730
I beg you, be by my side

00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:00.470
Yesterday...

00:24:00.470 --> 00:24:01.840
Today...

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:03.510
Even tomorrow...

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:07.710
The life I knew never seemed concrete,
forever nebulous and uncertain,

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:11.680
like silhouette art projected upon mist.

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:15.410
But a new wind blows through,
clearing out the mist.

00:24:16.820 --> 00:24:18.420
Forever present,

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:21.230
the dark murky abyss below
is swept by wind.

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:25.160
Babbling waters echo, the
introductory dance begins.

00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:26.890
The drum has been rapped.
